sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Frontend
    participant Auth
    participant Agent as admin-service
    participant Graph as LangGraph
    participant Sec as security-service
    participant Write as Mutation

    Admin->>UI: Demander une mutation
    UI->>Auth: Verifier la session
    Auth-->>UI: Session valide
    UI->>Agent: Transmettre la demande
    Agent->>Graph: Classifier l'intention
    opt Lecture preparatoire avant changement
        Graph->>Write: Lire l'etat courant
        Write-->>Graph: Etat actuel
    end
    Graph->>Sec: Verifier l'autorisation
    Sec-->>Graph: Autorisation
    Graph-->>UI: Demander confirmation
    Admin->>UI: Confirmer la mutation
    UI->>Graph: Poursuivre
    alt Mutation generale
        Graph->>Write: Executer la mutation
        Write-->>Graph: Resultat
    else Mutation de parametres RAG
        Graph->>Write: Modifier les parametres RAG
        Write-->>Graph: Parametres mis a jour
    end
    Graph-->>UI: Retourner le resultat
    UI-->>Admin: Afficher la confirmation
